From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Validate stored periods without starting the accounting daemon

Expose the existing complete read-only database parser before daemon setup.
Archive consumers can validate staged historical periods before retiring an
active writer or replacing its immutable snapshots.
Inspect each gzip read's status before another read can clear a truncated
member error, even when the requested bytes were returned in full.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
---
